      en: ["The port is situated in Miragoâne Bay, one of the deepest natural harbors in Haiti.", "Miragoâne is the capital of the Nippes department, which was established in 2003.", "The region was historically significant for bauxite exports until the 1980s.", "The port serves as an important secondary facility to relieve Port-au-Prince's main port.", "The town of Miragoâne was originally founded by the French in the 17th century.", "Regular ferry services connect the port with other coastal towns in the region."],
      es: ["Antiguo centro de exportación de bauxita (Reynolds Metals).", "Punto de importación más importante de coches usados de EE. UU.", "Situado en una de las bahías mejor protegidas de Haití.", "Factor económico central para el departamento de Nippes.", "Funciona como puerto de desahogo para Port-au-Prince.", "Cuenta con muelles para buques de carga de calado medio."],
      pt: ["Antigo centro de exportação de bauxita (Reynolds Metals).", "Ponto de importação mais importante de carros usados dos EUA.", "Situado numa das baías mais bem protegidas do Haiti.", "Fator económico central para o departamento de Nippes.", "Serve como porto de alívio para Port-au-Prince.", "Possui cais para navios de carga de calado médio."],
      fr: ["Ancien centre d'exportation de bauxite (Reynolds Metals).", "Principal point d'importation pour les voitures d'occasion des USA.", "Situé dans l'une des baies les mieux protégées d'Haïti.", "Facteur économique central pour le département des Nippes.", "Sert de port de délestage pour Port-au-Prince.", "Dispose de quais pour les cargos de tirant d'eau moyen."],
